  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the holiday spirit with this beautifully designed Christmas quilt set from Jeminise. Crafted for ultimate comfort and festive charm, this quilt features vibrant holiday prints and provides year-round coziness, making it a perfect addition to your seasonal home decor or a thoughtful gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Features bright, high-quality Christmas prints that create a warm, joyful atmosphere, adding a festive touch to any room.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber, ensuring warmth in winter and coolness in warmer months for versatile, year-round use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes:</strong> Available in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to perfectly fit beds, sofas, or as a decorative seasonal quilt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present for loved ones during Christmas, New Year, birthdays, or holiday celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle, tumble dry low or air dry, designed to be fade-resistant and wrinkle-free for lasting softness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one quilt, ready to enhance your bedding or living space.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight, Wrinkle-Free, Fade Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
